{
  "id": "ep0005",
  "theme": "The universe is mind-blowingly huge, but at least we're in it together.",
  "callback": "The licence plate in the stars",
  "generated_at": "2026-09-24T09:20:22.126467+00:00",
  "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash",
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "skit_boundary"
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line000.mp3",
      "text": "Okay, I just read that if the Sun were the size of a basketball, Earth would be a grain of sand about 30 metres away.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 6.94
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line001.mp3",
      "text": "Thirty metres? That's like from our couch to the end of the block. And the nearest star?",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 6.96
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line002.mp3",
      "text": "Another basketball... about 6,000 kilometres away. Roughly Toronto to... Lisbon?",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 7.99
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line003.mp3",
      "text": "So the universe is mostly empty parking lot.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 3.55
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line004.mp3",
      "text": "With a few basketballs. And a lot of really long walks.",
      "laugh": true,
      "duration_s": 4.97
    },
    {
      "type": "trigger_laugh"
    },
    {
      "type": "set_scene",
      "scene": "coffee_shop"
    },
    {
      "type": "skit_boundary"
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line005.mp3",
      "text": "I'm still stuck on that scale. It's like trying to imagine a trillion double-doubles.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 6.31
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line006.mp3",
      "text": "Please don't. I just got my head around the fact that a black hole's gravity is so strong that not even light can escape.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 8.09
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line007.mp3",
      "text": "Right. And the nearest one is Sagittarius A* at the centre of our galaxy, about 26,000 light-years away.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 8.64
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line008.mp3",
      "text": "So if it burped, we wouldn't know for 26,000 years.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 4.34
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line009.mp3",
      "text": "And by then, our double-doubles would be cold.",
      "laugh": true,
      "duration_s": 3.58
    },
    {
      "type": "trigger_laugh"
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line010.mp3",
      "text": "That's the real tragedy.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 2.3
    },
    {
      "type": "set_scene",
      "scene": "grocery"
    },
    {
      "type": "skit_boundary"
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "K",
      "file": "audio/line011.mp3",
      "text": "You two! Perfect timing. I've calculated that this entire No Thrills is a scale model of the solar system.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 6.07
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line012.mp3",
      "text": "Is that so?",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 1.87
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "K",
      "file": "audio/line013.mp3",
      "text": "The watermelon bin is the Sun. The frozen peas are Earth. And the toilet paper aisle? That's the Kuiper Belt.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 5.76
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line014.mp3",
      "text": "So where's Pluto?",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 2.09
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "K",
      "file": "audio/line015.mp3",
      "text": "Behind the meat counter. Ask for Sal. He knows.",
      "laugh": true,
      "duration_s": 3.02
    },
    {
      "type": "trigger_laugh"
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line016.mp3",
      "text": "We'll... take that under advisement.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 3.0
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "K",
      "file": "audio/line017.mp3",
      "text": "Also, I found a licence plate in the parking lot that says 'THE 6IX'. I think it's a sign from the cosmos. Gotta run!",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 6.55
    },
    {
      "type": "set_scene",
      "scene": "apartment"
    },
    {
      "type": "skit_boundary"
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line018.mp3",
      "text": "So Kessler thinks the frozen peas are Earth. I can't decide if that's genius or a cry for help.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 6.89
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line019.mp3",
      "text": "Honestly, it's not far off. The scale of the universe is absurd. There are more stars in the observable universe than grains of sand on all of Earth's beaches.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 10.99
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line020.mp3",
      "text": "And we're on one grain, in one beach, in one city, in one country... feeling tiny.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 5.57
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line021.mp3",
      "text": "But here's the thing: in all that emptiness, we found each other. That's not tiny. That's a miracle.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 8.18
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line022.mp3",
      "text": "A miracle with a licence plate that says 'THE 6IX'.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 3.89
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line023.mp3",
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "laugh": true,
      "duration_s": 1.87
    },
    {
      "type": "trigger_laugh"
    }
  ]
}